Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 01:30:41 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] ADD route selected-agent slash commands through backend
 command execution

Selected-agent chat input that starts with a slash command token uses the provider command hook so Codex slash commands resume the existing thread as commands instead of being delivered as normal prompts.
