 Workflow code must not hard-code `AgentKind::Codex` when the active profile supplies the provider.
+When selected-agent chat input begins with `/` followed immediately by a non-whitespace character,
+`CommandChat` routes it through `AgentBackend::run_command_streaming` instead of the normal
+`send_streaming` prompt path. Text such as `/ status` remains normal chat input because it is not a
+provider command token.
 
